  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SLE Strengthen youth capacities regarding e-waste management and resource circularity (Samsung E-waste project)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to address specific challenges related to behavior change regarding e-waste generation and management by fostering education and awareness. It will engage with youth (primary, secondary, and high school students) to support community change and assist high schoolers and vocational students in assessing their knowledge and innovations for the proper management of portable e-waste materials.</narrative>
  </description>
